  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia - Papua New Guinea Network (Phase 3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding under this initiative supports the third phase of the Australia-Papua New Guinea (PNG) Network. The key objective of this phase of the Network is to build on the momentum generated in the first two phases in enhancing people-to-people connections between Australia and Papua New Guinea, particularly with the emerging generations of future leaders.</narrative>
  </description>
